flowchart LR
  Client[Client request] -->|method, path, headers, body| Boundary[Gateway boundary]
  Boundary --> Validate[Request validation]
  Validate --> Context[Trusted request context]
  Context --> Auth[Verified identity claims]
  Auth --> Policy[Route policy and quota]
  Policy --> Registry[Trusted route registry]
  Registry --> Upstream[Approved service]
  Upstream -->|response| Filter[Response/header filtering]
  Filter --> Public[Public response]
  Context -. correlation metadata .-> Logs[Redacted logs]
  Policy -. decision code .-> Metrics[Metrics]
  Upstream -. service ID and duration .-> Traces[Trace spans]
  Filter -. status and latency .-> Metrics
